## 7. Reproduction and Guardrails

```powershell
python verify_ust_g3o_same_object_qutrit_chern_cutset.py
```

The result packet is
`state/ust_g3o_same_object_qutrit_chern_cutset.packet.json`.

The verifier reconstructs the exterior-algebra product and inverse BHT
integration exactly, checks the integral determinant congruence and compares
the resulting mixed Chern sign with the locked hidden Hull-Strominger target.

This theorem does not construct a holomorphic locally free `W9`, prove HYM,
solve the pointwise Bianchi identity, close the visible eta9 source, or prove
UV-complete quantum gravity.

